This repository contains a modified sample of the OWASP Benchmark for Java,
https://github.com/OWASP-Benchmark/BenchmarkJava, commit a0f07b8451902de4e3ff37aa03e40f4aeb3b4dbe,
licensed under the GNU General Public License v2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes made on 2026-10-26: 176 of the test cases and the helper classes and resources
they use were selected; classes, packages and servlet paths renamed; project names and
some string constants replaced; comments removed (line numbers kept); a minimal pom.xml
written; git history replaced. The script that makes these changes is
vulnbench/java/build.py in vulnbench-eval.
